% SOURCE: ICOT TR-524, K. Yoshida, "The SIMPOS Distributed File System -- Its Design and Implementation", Nov. 1989
% PDF page 18, printed folio 17. Section 3.6 "Communication Control", in-text example: process P3 at site icpsi100
% opens a remote file by global pathname. Transcribed by eye from 300dpi crop (A/work/tr0524/x18b.png).

:open(#binary_file, File, ``icpsi200::>sys>user>gee>humm.txt'',
                                            exclusive, suppress),
:read_data(File, String),
:close(File),
